(3396829, 473188, 50034, '<td valign="top">"I left my heart in Francine''s Willow!"</td>', '"I left my heart in Francine''s Willow!"', '2007-02-23 06:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396838, 472872, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Thrilling colors in a silhoutte photo that seems almost playful</b> because the twigs on the left give <i>a hint of children "high-steppin'' it" away from their momma.</i>  Sadly, however, I believe that the "busy"ness around the subject will probably hold down the scores.  Yet, <b>IMHO...this is a very nice photo.  :)</b></td>', 'Thrilling colors in a silhoutte photo that seems almost playful because the twigs on the left give a hint of children "high-steppin'' it" away from their momma.  Sadly, however, I believe that the "busy"ness around the subject will probably hold down the scores.  Yet, IMHO...this is a very nice photo.  :)', '2007-02-23 06:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396844, 473672, 50034, '<td valign="top"><i>"One, two, three &amp; four,...Stretch right now &amp; do it some more!  Five, six, seven, eight,...Reach for the sky &amp; don''t be late!"</i> <b>Just in case anyone was interesting</b>, this is why trees always look so lean with rock-hard abs...<b>This photo seems to be a hint of the regulars at my Body Pump class.  :)</b></td>', '"One, two, three & four,...Stretch right now & do it some more!  Five, six, seven, eight,...Reach for the sky & don''t be late!" Just in case anyone was interesting, this is why trees always look so lean with rock-hard abs...This photo seems to be a hint of the regulars at my Body Pump class.  :)', '2007-02-23 06:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
