(3396914, 473620, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice still life.  Nice idea...Sounds like one of my own, and sadly it will score just about as well because its out there on the edge of DMNC.  <b>I wish you all the best!</b> because <i>people like us tend to over-think our compositions.</i>  You obviously gave this much thought.  Consider doing what I have begun to do, "bounce your ideas off" a respected friend or relative who has shown consistent art appreciation.  My wife has helped me on numerous occasions.  (I hope this is helpful.)</td>', 'Nice still life.  Nice idea...Sounds like one of my own, and sadly it will score just about as well because its out there on the edge of DMNC.  I wish you all the best! because people like us tend to over-think our compositions.  You obviously gave this much thought.  Consider doing what I have begun to do, "bounce your ideas off" a respected friend or relative who has shown consistent art appreciation.  My wife has helped me on numerous occasions.  (I hope this is helpful.)', '2007-02-23 07:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
