(3397603, 473551, 55956, '<td valign="top">good the composition, the sky isn''t great and the colours a bit flat, but the good star was with you :) I don''t know your present score but I am sure that will be a good final score. 8</td>', 'good the composition, the sky isn''t great and the colours a bit flat, but the good star was with you :) I don''t know your present score but I am sure that will be a good final score. 8', '2007-02-23 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
