(3399171, 473341, 50034, '<td valign="top">Superb view of the Sydney Opera House at dusk!  Quite unique in effect &amp; feel.  Sadly, IMHO the palm tree silhouette (while qualifying this photo for the tree competition) actually distracts from an exquisite location photo.  Improvements?  If you had stepped left or right about 5-10 feet to physically crop out the palm tree and level the fencing at the water''s edge (by sight) it would be a 10 in another contest, like the February, 2007 Free Study, but don''t try it now...Boarder-Line DQ!  :(</td>', 'Superb view of the Sydney Opera House at dusk!  Quite unique in effect & feel.  Sadly, IMHO the palm tree silhouette (while qualifying this photo for the tree competition) actually distracts from an exquisite location photo.  Improvements?  If you had stepped left or right about 5-10 feet to physically crop out the palm tree and level the fencing at the water''s edge (by sight) it would be a 10 in another contest, like the February, 2007 Free Study, but don''t try it now...Boarder-Line DQ!  :(', '2007-02-23 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399174, 471163, 50034, '<td valign="top">It''s a member of the Raspberry Forest in VeggieTale''s <b>Lord of the Beans.</b></td>', 'It''s a member of the Raspberry Forest in VeggieTale''s Lord of the Beans.', '2007-02-23 19:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399175, 472844, 50034, '<td valign="top">Cute!  :)</td>', 'Cute!  :)', '2007-02-23 19:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399176, 473495, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice frame!</td>', 'Wow!  Nice frame!', '2007-02-23 19:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399180, 470897, 40344, '<td valign="top">Very nice tranquilitree.</td>', 'Very nice tranquilitree.', '2007-02-23 19:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399181, 470455, 50034, '<td valign="top">Interesting View!  :)</td>', 'Interesting View!  :)', '2007-02-23 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399184, 473551, 40344, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2007-02-23 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399206, 473436, 18349, '<td valign="top">Holy guacamole this is cool.  Love, love, LOVE it.  :)</td>', 'Holy guacamole this is cool.  Love, love, LOVE it.  :)', '2007-02-23 19:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399208, 473721, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites...very well captured and presented.</td>', 'One of my favorites...very well captured and presented.', '2007-02-23 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399209, 473025, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites...love the subtle colors.  I appreciate the "layering" of objects from foreground to background...it really makes the composition exquisite.  :)</td>', 'One of my favorites...love the subtle colors.  I appreciate the "layering" of objects from foreground to background...it really makes the composition exquisite.  :)', '2007-02-23 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399210, 471325, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very surreal and emotive.</td>', 'Very surreal and emotive.', '2007-02-23 19:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399212, 470750, 18349, '<td valign="top">I hope this isn''t underappreciated...it''s got personality and an emotive "pull" that draws me in.  I''m weird like that.  ;)</td>', 'I hope this isn''t underappreciated...it''s got personality and an emotive "pull" that draws me in.  I''m weird like that.  ;)', '2007-02-23 19:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399213, 471551, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and clarity...I do find the horizon line, which splits the image in two horizontally, a bit of a distraction...I think more sky or more foreground would make the image a bit more dynamic.  Still a solid entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and clarity...I do find the horizon line, which splits the image in two horizontally, a bit of a distraction...I think more sky or more foreground would make the image a bit more dynamic.  Still a solid entry for this challenge.', '2007-02-23 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399214, 472513, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has an antique quality to it...which I love.  Great in its simplicity and timelessness.  I''d imagine this would be an awesome print.  :)</td>', 'This has an antique quality to it...which I love.  Great in its simplicity and timelessness.  I''d imagine this would be an awesome print.  :)', '2007-02-23 19:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399216, 473571, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful light and composition.', '2007-02-23 19:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399225, 473288, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and use of black and white.  I hope you don''t suffer from anal-retentive voters who believe this isn''t about a tree...without the tree the tire swing would be useless.  Nice entry.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and use of black and white.  I hope you don''t suffer from anal-retentive voters who believe this isn''t about a tree...without the tree the tire swing would be useless.  Nice entry.', '2007-02-23 19:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399228, 470891, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly cool and fun.  It has a certain look about it that reminds me of a museum diorama or display.  Good color and composition.</td>', 'This is incredibly cool and fun.  It has a certain look about it that reminds me of a museum diorama or display.  Good color and composition.', '2007-02-23 19:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399231, 473672, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good use of converging verticals to add more drama to the scene.  I find myself longing to see the base of the "star" tree in the foreground.  Good use of b/w as well.</td>', 'Good use of converging verticals to add more drama to the scene.  I find myself longing to see the base of the "star" tree in the foreground.  Good use of b/w as well.', '2007-02-23 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399244, 473551, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a lucky capture!  Very well seen and composed.</td>', 'What a lucky capture!  Very well seen and composed.', '2007-02-23 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399249, 470002, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a bucolic and tranquil scene.  I know that cropping wasn''t allowed, but after the challenge I think this would be stronger if the left side was cropped almost to the cow, and the right side ever so slightly to get rid of the tiny piece of a branch and the bright white thingy in the background.  Still, a nicely captured slice of rural life.  :)</td>', 'What a bucolic and tranquil scene.  I know that cropping wasn''t allowed, but after the challenge I think this would be stronger if the left side was cropped almost to the cow, and the right side ever so slightly to get rid of the tiny piece of a branch and the bright white thingy in the background.  Still, a nicely captured slice of rural life.  :)', '2007-02-23 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399250, 473263, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the scene itself but I''m not a fan of the major distortion...it works for a lot of things but I don''t care for it''s use in this instance.  Excellent composition and exposure control; color looks good as well.  Solid entry.</td>', 'I like the scene itself but I''m not a fan of the major distortion...it works for a lot of things but I don''t care for it''s use in this instance.  Excellent composition and exposure control; color looks good as well.  Solid entry.', '2007-02-23 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399257, 472883, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Great color and exposure control; composition is very nice.  I wish I could see the tip-top of the tree. Very nice entry.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Great color and exposure control; composition is very nice.  I wish I could see the tip-top of the tree. Very nice entry.', '2007-02-23 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399261, 473664, 67237, '<td valign="top">This is an eye catching composition with great DOF. I like the strong backlight behind the  main subject and how the projected shadow gets wider as it approaches the viewer.</td>', 'This is an eye catching composition with great DOF. I like the strong backlight behind the  main subject and how the projected shadow gets wider as it approaches the viewer.', '2007-02-23 20:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399298, 473436, 73564, '<td valign="top">way cool!!!</td>', 'way cool!!!', '2007-02-23 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399305, 473019, 73564, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, nice even color.</td>', 'Cool picture, nice even color.', '2007-02-23 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399313, 470750, 34618, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. great title-this does look magical. color is soooo smooth and compelling. i really love this and think it rates a 9!</td>', 'very nice shot. great title-this does look magical. color is soooo smooth and compelling. i really love this and think it rates a 9!', '2007-02-23 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399332, 470989, 34618, '<td valign="top">nice. perhaps without the house it might be more surreal. had you been able to bounce some light in between the front two trees to reveal the object there might also have added to the overall effect. not sure what that object is and would like to.</td>', 'nice. perhaps without the house it might be more surreal. had you been able to bounce some light in between the front two trees to reveal the object there might also have added to the overall effect. not sure what that object is and would like to.', '2007-02-23 20:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399335, 473059, 34618, '<td valign="top">gentle color. nice image. dof right on.</td>', 'gentle color. nice image. dof right on.', '2007-02-23 20:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399339, 471176, 73564, '<td valign="top">i like how the tilt puts a twist on it!</td>', 'i like how the tilt puts a twist on it!', '2007-02-23 20:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399343, 473598, 34618, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. love the mood. isn''t fog great? bad weather = good pics, yes?</td>', 'very nice shot. love the mood. isn''t fog great? bad weather = good pics, yes?', '2007-02-23 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399349, 473545, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. nicely balanced. sky is very interesting and balanced. my only criticism is that it seems too sharpened to me. was it?</td>', 'this is a great shot. nicely balanced. sky is very interesting and balanced. my only criticism is that it seems too sharpened to me. was it?', '2007-02-23 20:39:34.000000', NULL, 1);
