(3399351, 473580, 34618, '<td valign="top">very zen. looks like a "9" to me!</td>', 'very zen. looks like a "9" to me!', '2007-02-23 20:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399356, 470467, 34618, '<td valign="top">wow. nice color and dof! love it. this is a 9.</td>', 'wow. nice color and dof! love it. this is a 9.', '2007-02-23 20:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399359, 471491, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is a really good photo. definitely a 9</td>', 'this is a really good photo. definitely a 9', '2007-02-23 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399363, 473239, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is interesting. nice that the subject is partially in shade. i wish the top hadn''t gotten cropped.</td>', 'this is interesting. nice that the subject is partially in shade. i wish the top hadn''t gotten cropped.', '2007-02-23 20:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399364, 472504, 34618, '<td valign="top">i like the concept, but i think it''s just a little too much frame.</td>', 'i like the concept, but i think it''s just a little too much frame.', '2007-02-23 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399370, 473013, 34618, '<td valign="top">very evocative. i''ll be looking for more details on how you took this. seems like an "8" to me.</td>', 'very evocative. i''ll be looking for more details on how you took this. seems like an "8" to me.', '2007-02-23 20:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399378, 473350, 34618, '<td valign="top">interesting but not compelling. my two cents is that if you shot this with your camera right down at ground level of the walkway it would be much stronger.</td>', 'interesting but not compelling. my two cents is that if you shot this with your camera right down at ground level of the walkway it would be much stronger.', '2007-02-23 20:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399383, 473313, 34618, '<td valign="top">love it. Would you object to a "10"? (I''m a sucker for IR)</td>', 'love it. Would you object to a "10"? (I''m a sucker for IR)', '2007-02-23 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399391, 472523, 34618, '<td valign="top">this would be stronger from a more interesting angle. maybe from the ground?? not sure, but it''s cute... just not compelling. maybe more dof. more sky. it just seems a bit stark. hope this is helpful. it is cute.</td>', 'this would be stronger from a more interesting angle. maybe from the ground?? not sure, but it''s cute... just not compelling. maybe more dof. more sky. it just seems a bit stark. hope this is helpful. it is cute.', '2007-02-23 20:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399395, 473571, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is a very cool picture. "9"</td>', 'this is a very cool picture. "9"', '2007-02-23 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399400, 472451, 34618, '<td valign="top">my only comment is that the road got cut off. i think it should be in tact and let the trees get the crop.</td>', 'my only comment is that the road got cut off. i think it should be in tact and let the trees get the crop.', '2007-02-23 20:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399412, 473643, 60073, '<td valign="top">would have been nicer if the truck wasn''t there</td>', 'would have been nicer if the truck wasn''t there', '2007-02-23 20:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399438, 472222, 34618, '<td valign="top">True cruelty at work here were that this travesty was deliberately perpetrated at the hands of a branch wielding vandal. If only the result of natural "causes" however, then one must accept change as the only constant and move on. Either way though, we must celebrate the fact that it has been documented for posterity.</td>', 'True cruelty at work here were that this travesty was deliberately perpetrated at the hands of a branch wielding vandal. If only the result of natural "causes" however, then one must accept change as the only constant and move on. Either way though, we must celebrate the fact that it has been documented for posterity.', '2007-02-23 21:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399439, 470339, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is really a great shot!</td>', 'this is really a great shot!', '2007-02-23 21:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399443, 470898, 34618, '<td valign="top">the title really says it all. very nice. my only suggestion would be to have not cropped out the left hand side of the tree.</td>', 'the title really says it all. very nice. my only suggestion would be to have not cropped out the left hand side of the tree.', '2007-02-23 21:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399446, 472663, 34618, '<td valign="top">love it.</td>', 'love it.', '2007-02-23 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399449, 471176, 34618, '<td valign="top">i like this, but i think the unusual angle is just a hair over the top.</td>', 'i like this, but i think the unusual angle is just a hair over the top.', '2007-02-23 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399453, 473413, 34618, '<td valign="top">imho, the foreground objects don''t help this otherwise very interesting and well exposed, compelling great tree. it is unfortunate they had to plant blue pipe there, huh?</td>', 'imho, the foreground objects don''t help this otherwise very interesting and well exposed, compelling great tree. it is unfortunate they had to plant blue pipe there, huh?', '2007-02-23 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399454, 472798, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice composition.</td>', 'this is a really nice composition.', '2007-02-23 21:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399457, 473535, 34618, '<td valign="top">cute. and nice.</td>', 'cute. and nice.', '2007-02-23 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399459, 472496, 34618, '<td valign="top">there is something a bit eerie about this and i like it a lot. primeval.</td>', 'there is something a bit eerie about this and i like it a lot. primeval.', '2007-02-23 21:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399461, 471797, 34618, '<td valign="top">excellent entry.</td>', 'excellent entry.', '2007-02-23 21:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399464, 470944, 34618, '<td valign="top">excellent entry. i really think you nailed the colors. very nice.</td>', 'excellent entry. i really think you nailed the colors. very nice.', '2007-02-23 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399470, 473593, 34618, '<td valign="top">please give us some details... very interesting. it cries out for a bit more tweaking after the challenge is over, does it not? Based on potential as well as execution, I''m giving it a 9.</td>', 'please give us some details... very interesting. it cries out for a bit more tweaking after the challenge is over, does it not? Based on potential as well as execution, I''m giving it a 9.', '2007-02-23 21:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399473, 473642, 34618, '<td valign="top">is it possible to take a bad shot at yosemite? this pic rocks and really cries out for more robust editing after the challenge. still it''s a 9.5 now.</td>', 'is it possible to take a bad shot at yosemite? this pic rocks and really cries out for more robust editing after the challenge. still it''s a 9.5 now.', '2007-02-23 21:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399474, 473672, 34618, '<td valign="top">nice pic. nice title.</td>', 'nice pic. nice title.', '2007-02-23 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399476, 473563, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool picture.</td>', 'this is a really cool picture.', '2007-02-23 21:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399481, 473554, 34618, '<td valign="top">unlike many in this challenge, your cropping didn''t cut off the tree, so i think it''s very good. i wish the tree had a bit more contrast to pull it out from the background, though. i''d like to see some details on how you did this and wonder if a wider angle lens and closer proximity to the tree might have made it stand out more from the background. what did you shoot this with?</td>', 'unlike many in this challenge, your cropping didn''t cut off the tree, so i think it''s very good. i wish the tree had a bit more contrast to pull it out from the background, though. i''d like to see some details on how you did this and wonder if a wider angle lens and closer proximity to the tree might have made it stand out more from the background. what did you shoot this with?', '2007-02-23 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399485, 473467, 34618, '<td valign="top">very nice composition, dof, exposure and great color! what''s to say. this is a 9.</td>', 'very nice composition, dof, exposure and great color! what''s to say. this is a 9.', '2007-02-23 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399486, 473717, 66310, '<td valign="top">lack of focus</td>', 'lack of focus', '2007-02-23 21:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399488, 472831, 66310, '<td valign="top">I like. Nice tension and colors</td>', 'I like. Nice tension and colors', '2007-02-23 21:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399490, 470341, 34618, '<td valign="top">this is really an amazing picture and title. if you could work this to pull the tree out some more from the background and get those clouds up a bit it would definitely be a 10. i love the foreground grass!</td>', 'this is really an amazing picture and title. if you could work this to pull the tree out some more from the background and get those clouds up a bit it would definitely be a 10. i love the foreground grass!', '2007-02-23 21:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399509, 473603, 34618, '<td valign="top">slap a suit on me for copying this to check out a theory, but it looks about 100 times better in Photoshop against a <i>black</i> background. try it. this PANTONE Cool Gray 1 C background that they use is definitely doing a disservice to your really nice, moody silhouette, imho. this is at least an 8.5 score. nice shot!</td>', 'slap a suit on me for copying this to check out a theory, but it looks about 100 times better in Photoshop against a black background. try it. this PANTONE Cool Gray 1 C background that they use is definitely doing a disservice to your really nice, moody silhouette, imho. this is at least an 8.5 score. nice shot!', '2007-02-23 21:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399512, 472901, 34618, '<td valign="top">technically, this doesn''t really meet the challenge spec... there are no trees. but it''s too cool (including title), so i''m giving it an 8 anyway.</td>', 'technically, this doesn''t really meet the challenge spec... there are no trees. but it''s too cool (including title), so i''m giving it an 8 anyway.', '2007-02-23 21:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399516, 472933, 34618, '<td valign="top">mr. chipmunk is really cute. cool dof and crisp image, too. nice.</td>', 'mr. chipmunk is really cute. cool dof and crisp image, too. nice.', '2007-02-23 21:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399517, 472898, 34618, '<td valign="top">this picture cries out for a dark background. dpc''s webpage doesn''t do it justice. very moody and nice shot.</td>', 'this picture cries out for a dark background. dpc''s webpage doesn''t do it justice. very moody and nice shot.', '2007-02-23 21:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399523, 473698, 34618, '<td valign="top">i''m going to haunt you for life if you don''t, after the voting ends, and give us some details on the circumstances surrounding this shot after I''m giving you an 9 for a score. so please, what''s up with this shot? what''s the white, dome-shaped object near the top?</td>', 'i''m going to haunt you for life if you don''t, after the voting ends, and give us some details on the circumstances surrounding this shot after I''m giving you an 9 for a score. so please, what''s up with this shot? what''s the white, dome-shaped object near the top?', '2007-02-23 21:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399528, 473686, 34618, '<td valign="top">VERY nice. some might not, but i really like the dof you chose.</td>', 'VERY nice. some might not, but i really like the dof you chose.', '2007-02-23 21:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399532, 471040, 34618, '<td valign="top">i dropped a copy of this into Photoshop and it really looks 100% better on a black background. it''s really an 8 or 9, but the light background is going to confuse some people, imho. anyway, very nice shot! it would be nice if dpc let us have a "preference" for the background color when judging some of these entries.</td>', 'i dropped a copy of this into Photoshop and it really looks 100% better on a black background. it''s really an 8 or 9, but the light background is going to confuse some people, imho. anyway, very nice shot! it would be nice if dpc let us have a "preference" for the background color when judging some of these entries.', '2007-02-23 21:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3399548, 470532, 43656, '<td valign="top">Shooting with a longer lens from further away would have help the appearance of the trees leaning in.</td>', 'Shooting with a longer lens from further away would have help the appearance of the trees leaning in.', '2007-02-23 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
