(3412324, 473252, 74039, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2007-02-28 04:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412330, 470467, 66932, '<td valign="top">I love the water droplets on the pussy willow and the use of depth of focus is good.  Some of the brighter background is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'I love the water droplets on the pussy willow and the use of depth of focus is good.  Some of the brighter background is a bit distracting though.', '2007-02-28 04:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412333, 473608, 66932, '<td valign="top">That is very good.  But the trees are a bit peripheral to the real content of the picture.  Thanks for showing it anyway.</td>', 'That is very good.  But the trees are a bit peripheral to the real content of the picture.  Thanks for showing it anyway.', '2007-02-28 05:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412336, 473278, 66932, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get this one.  Is that water? Or snow? Or even fog?</td>', 'I don''t quite get this one.  Is that water? Or snow? Or even fog?', '2007-02-28 05:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412338, 470409, 66932, '<td valign="top">Disappointing I''m afraid.  The light wasn''t really good enough to give the picture impact.</td>', 'Disappointing I''m afraid.  The light wasn''t really good enough to give the picture impact.', '2007-02-28 05:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412339, 470111, 66932, '<td valign="top">What a sad picture!  Well spotted.</td>', 'What a sad picture!  Well spotted.', '2007-02-28 05:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412341, 470264, 66932, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I love the silhouette of a shapely tree in winter.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I love the silhouette of a shapely tree in winter.', '2007-02-28 05:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412344, 470277, 66932, '<td valign="top">A good one but I feel it needs something or someone on the road in place of the bride and groom.</td>', 'A good one but I feel it needs something or someone on the road in place of the bride and groom.', '2007-02-28 05:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412345, 472471, 66932, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - I love it!</td>', 'Brilliant - I love it!', '2007-02-28 05:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412348, 472504, 66932, '<td valign="top">That is a great picture.  And the mountain was in a dreamy mood.</td>', 'That is a great picture.  And the mountain was in a dreamy mood.', '2007-02-28 05:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412350, 473616, 66932, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly attractive picture for such an uninspiring subject.  The shape is nice and the sky lovely.  But what a way to treat a tree!</td>', 'Surprisingly attractive picture for such an uninspiring subject.  The shape is nice and the sky lovely.  But what a way to treat a tree!', '2007-02-28 05:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412351, 473554, 66932, '<td valign="top">I like that very much.  And I would like to see another shot of the same subject under better lighting conditions.</td>', 'I like that very much.  And I would like to see another shot of the same subject under better lighting conditions.', '2007-02-28 05:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412356, 472451, 66932, '<td valign="top">That is a picture by someone who really appreciates the magnificent pattern of tree bark.</td>', 'That is a picture by someone who really appreciates the magnificent pattern of tree bark.', '2007-02-28 05:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412363, 473737, 66932, '<td valign="top">Good.  This type of shot is quite popular but seldom does it come off as well as this.  I think it is the network of twigs that makes the shot.</td>', 'Good.  This type of shot is quite popular but seldom does it come off as well as this.  I think it is the network of twigs that makes the shot.', '2007-02-28 05:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412367, 473314, 66932, '<td valign="top">The vista is great but it wouldn''t have been much without that tree.  Lovely shape and well placed in the frame.  You had good lighting conditions for this one.</td>', 'The vista is great but it wouldn''t have been much without that tree.  Lovely shape and well placed in the frame.  You had good lighting conditions for this one.', '2007-02-28 05:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412370, 472831, 66932, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Trees really look good in silhouette in winter and that sky is amazing.</td>', 'Great picture.  Trees really look good in silhouette in winter and that sky is amazing.', '2007-02-28 05:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412372, 473714, 66932, '<td valign="top">A simple subject produces a very pleasing picture.</td>', 'A simple subject produces a very pleasing picture.', '2007-02-28 05:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412373, 470890, 66932, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I love the lighting on this tree.</td>', 'Well done.  I love the lighting on this tree.', '2007-02-28 05:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412375, 473350, 66932, '<td valign="top">It is a nice picture - but the trees definitely seem subdued by the architecture.  At least they haven''t been mutilated by a "tree surgeon" - yet.</td>', 'It is a nice picture - but the trees definitely seem subdued by the architecture.  At least they haven''t been mutilated by a "tree surgeon" - yet.', '2007-02-28 05:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3412554, 473551, 38032, '<td valign="top">wow- that''s pretty crazy - striking image.  This was tough to crop i would think .. that''s the only thing I could possibly change, but I''m not sure exactly where to move the frame since you have 3 areas of interest here. It seems awfully narrow for not being croped but that must be an illusion.  I would have soiled myself if I had this shot in my camera I swear ;P</td>', 'wow- that''s pretty crazy - striking image.  This was tough to crop i would think .. that''s the only thing I could possibly change, but I''m not sure exactly where to move the frame since you have 3 areas of interest here. It seems awfully narrow for not being croped but that must be an illusion.  I would have soiled myself if I had this shot in my camera I swear ;P', '2007-02-28 07:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
