(3414448, 471008, 62637, '<td valign="top">the sky is a little washed out, but the yellows and greens in the field are nice and vibrant.  bumping from a 5 to a 6 (huge difference, i know :-P)</td>', 'the sky is a little washed out, but the yellows and greens in the field are nice and vibrant.  bumping from a 5 to a 6 (huge difference, i know :-P)', '2007-02-28 15:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
