(3415645, 473253, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although this looks more like a raspberry cane than a tree, this is a lovely photo, beautiful exposure control and composition with drop.</td>', 'Although this looks more like a raspberry cane than a tree, this is a lovely photo, beautiful exposure control and composition with drop.', '2007-02-28 22:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
