(3419130, 473664, 74534, '<td valign="top">Like the shadow on the ground leading into the camera. I would have liked a brighter image though, with more detail on the ground (and stronger contrast with the shadow) and lighter sky.</td>', 'Like the shadow on the ground leading into the camera. I would have liked a brighter image though, with more detail on the ground (and stronger contrast with the shadow) and lighter sky.', '2007-03-01 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
