(3419141, 473574, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and shot, the clarity and sharpness are right on. And the composition is perfect. Good work.</td>', 'Nice idea and shot, the clarity and sharpness are right on. And the composition is perfect. Good work.', '2007-03-01 15:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
