(3421455, 471176, 72972, '<td valign="top">Crop a little off the top to right below those buildings in the back, so the image is balanced equally upper-left to lower-right and it is perfect. If it wasn''t tilted it would not be a good shot at all, too bad you couldn''t crop for entry.</td>', 'Crop a little off the top to right below those buildings in the back, so the image is balanced equally upper-left to lower-right and it is perfect. If it wasn''t tilted it would not be a good shot at all, too bad you couldn''t crop for entry.', '2007-03-02 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
