(3421679, 471782, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice job! That''s a splendid score!  I thought the brightness with your choice of sepia gave this a spooky old picture feeling.  It''s almost like you accomplished an in-camera diffuse glow!  Amazing tree.  Excellent choices all around :)</td>', 'Nice job! That''s a splendid score!  I thought the brightness with your choice of sepia gave this a spooky old picture feeling.  It''s almost like you accomplished an in-camera diffuse glow!  Amazing tree.  Excellent choices all around :)', '2007-03-02 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421681, 470817, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Should have scored much higher. I think it meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'Very nice. Should have scored much higher. I think it meets the challenge very well.', '2007-03-02 02:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421695, 473551, 55956, '<td valign="top">"Better to be lucky than good" I agree with you :). congrats!!!</td>', '"Better to be lucky than good" I agree with you :). congrats!!!', '2007-03-02 02:13:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421706, 473361, 66384, '<td valign="top">Holy smokes, you should get some sort of special sucker for no comments at all. I guess no one cares about that gentle reminder to comment on the shots you are scoring lower than 4.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a marvelous old tree, the voters should have had a little more respect for it. The focus seems a little soft, and there isn''t anything else of interest in the shot. That may be why the score was low.</td>', 'Holy smokes, you should get some sort of special sucker for no comments at all. I guess no one cares about that gentle reminder to comment on the shots you are scoring lower than 4. Anyway, I think this is a marvelous old tree, the voters should have had a little more respect for it. The focus seems a little soft, and there isn''t anything else of interest in the shot. That may be why the score was low.', '2007-03-02 02:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421729, 473362, 31443, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Tareq! Very nice shot and view..</td>', 'Congratulations Tareq! Very nice shot and view..', '2007-03-02 02:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421734, 473361, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like that it''s a very complicated tree, like alien antlers :) Your sky is in great shape too, no blow out.  The only thing missing is that darn partridge ;-)</td>', 'I like that it''s a very complicated tree, like alien antlers :) Your sky is in great shape too, no blow out.  The only thing missing is that darn partridge ;-)', '2007-03-02 02:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421736, 472872, 67145, '<td valign="top">jane .. this is the most stunning shot ever ... congratulations on an absolutely fantastic photograph .. fantastic colours, excellent silhouette, love your composition, great contrasts, amazingly beautiful scene ... minimal editing <b>WOW</b> .... <br/>congratulations on a great score!! ..</td>', 'jane .. this is the most stunning shot ever ... congratulations on an absolutely fantastic photograph .. fantastic colours, excellent silhouette, love your composition, great contrasts, amazingly beautiful scene ... minimal editing WOW .... congratulations on a great score!! ..', '2007-03-02 02:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3421744, 473557, 31403, '<td valign="top">Congrats - I think this is much better than it''s placement - but look on the really bright side - no 1s!  :-)<br/> <br/>Nice to see you enter again - this is terrific work.</td>', 'Congrats - I think this is much better than it''s placement - but look on the really bright side - no 1s!  :-) Nice to see you enter again - this is terrific work.', '2007-03-02 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 0);
