(3422049, 470750, 35602, '<td valign="top">I really like what you tried to do here.  The only thing I would recommend is to use a partial vaseline smear to give a bit more unique appeal to the top area of the image.    As an abstract this is fab, and I love the image as it is, but by dp standards a bit more detail along the top probably would have given you a few extra fractions in your score.</td>', 'I really like what you tried to do here.  The only thing I would recommend is to use a partial vaseline smear to give a bit more unique appeal to the top area of the image.    As an abstract this is fab, and I love the image as it is, but by dp standards a bit more detail along the top probably would have given you a few extra fractions in your score.', '2007-03-02 07:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
