(3422052, 470208, 23484, '<td valign="top">Jason, I have two thoughts on this. 1. This is a really neat abstract looking shot with the lines in it. A little saturation boost might have made this even more interesting. 2. This would also be really cool if the lines weren''t there and it was just a solid red background.  The composition is absolutely perfect.<br/> <br/>Edit: Forget what I said about the saturation boost.  I didn''t realize till after that this was a minimal entry.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-02 08:00:06.</i></td>', 'Jason, I have two thoughts on this. 1. This is a really neat abstract looking shot with the lines in it. A little saturation boost might have made this even more interesting. 2. This would also be really cool if the lines weren''t there and it was just a solid red background.  The composition is absolutely perfect. Edit: Forget what I said about the saturation boost.  I didn''t realize till after that this was a minimal entry.', '2007-03-02 07:04:36.000000', '2007-03-02 08:00:06.000000', 0),
(3422068, 470835, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot Amy, beautiful colours!</td>', 'Very nice shot Amy, beautiful colours!', '2007-03-02 07:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3422079, 473436, 66353, '<td valign="top">I was away and didn''t vote on this challenge - but if I had, I believe I would have pressed "10" on the bar (which only happened once before in my time here).<br/> <br/>To me this picture proves that it''s not the equipment and you don''t have to be a PS wiz. to make great pictures - when the right person is behind the camera amazing things can happen.<br/> <br/>This is extremely well done and going straight into my fav''s.</td>', 'I was away and didn''t vote on this challenge - but if I had, I believe I would have pressed "10" on the bar (which only happened once before in my time here). To me this picture proves that it''s not the equipment and you don''t have to be a PS wiz. to make great pictures - when the right person is behind the camera amazing things can happen. This is extremely well done and going straight into my fav''s.', '2007-03-02 07:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
