(3422146, 472872, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jane!!  This is so awesome!   As I think I told you but I was one of your five 10''s, so I think this deserved even higher than 6.3 (maybe closer to what all your commenters gave you :)   And I''m so impressed that you got a shot like this with minimal editing.  You are totally awesome, and I think before long. ..this one won''t even be on your highest rates photos page :)   You have a lot of talent, and your photos are beautiful!<br/> <br/>I have enjoyed your pictures so so much!  Thank you for sharing St. Helens, Merseside with us.   It was such a treat and privilege!  <br/> <br/>Blessings!<br/></td>', 'Jane!!  This is so awesome!   As I think I told you but I was one of your five 10''s, so I think this deserved even higher than 6.3 (maybe closer to what all your commenters gave you :)   And I''m so impressed that you got a shot like this with minimal editing.  You are totally awesome, and I think before long. ..this one won''t even be on your highest rates photos page :)   You have a lot of talent, and your photos are beautiful! I have enjoyed your pictures so so much!  Thank you for sharing St. Helens, Merseside with us.   It was such a treat and privilege!   Blessings!', '2007-03-02 07:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
