(3422260, 473661, 51538, '<td valign="top">You got a 5 from me - but that''s all relative to my inability to recognize a good thing when I see it.  It happens all the time when I vote, no matter how hard to try and choose.  Anyway, I did come back partly because I saw it pop up on recently commented on and remembered it from the challenge.  The key point is, I think, "I remembered it."  It is subtle and modest, especially in the context of a competition, but very effective and evocative.  Nice work.</td>', 'You got a 5 from me - but that''s all relative to my inability to recognize a good thing when I see it.  It happens all the time when I vote, no matter how hard to try and choose.  Anyway, I did come back partly because I saw it pop up on recently commented on and remembered it from the challenge.  The key point is, I think, "I remembered it."  It is subtle and modest, especially in the context of a competition, but very effective and evocative.  Nice work.', '2007-03-02 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
