(3422302, 472137, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, I really like the outline of the hill and how you frame the photo with the trees at the right with the background light coming into the image from the right. The little bright spot just above the hill line to the left is a bit distracting but otherwise the photo couldn''t be better imo. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Very nice image, I really like the outline of the hill and how you frame the photo with the trees at the right with the background light coming into the image from the right. The little bright spot just above the hill line to the left is a bit distracting but otherwise the photo couldn''t be better imo. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-03-02 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
