(3422310, 473004, 70181, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the great comments, everybody.  I had a blast taking the shots that day, as Mack puts on a great show.  He loves climbing around in the fruit trees.  And I got so lucky that there was a beautiful blue sky that day to shoot him against.  A top 20 finish in my first challenge here, I''m a happy boy.</td>', 'Thank you for all the great comments, everybody.  I had a blast taking the shots that day, as Mack puts on a great show.  He loves climbing around in the fruit trees.  And I got so lucky that there was a beautiful blue sky that day to shoot him against.  A top 20 finish in my first challenge here, I''m a happy boy.', '2007-03-02 09:02:22.000000', NULL, 0),
