(3423018, 473436, 45519, '<td valign="top">Simply brilliant capture ... made all the more so by following the Minimal Editing rules.  Wow.<br/> <br/>I''m curious how the stars remain sharp points in the sky with a 30sec exposure.  Is this a combination of them being fairly low on the horizon, versus overhead, along with a wide FOV (WA shot)?  I''ve noticed "star trails" in some of my shots with less than 30 seconds.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the blue; well deserved.</td>', 'Simply brilliant capture ... made all the more so by following the Minimal Editing rules.  Wow. I''m curious how the stars remain sharp points in the sky with a 30sec exposure.  Is this a combination of them being fairly low on the horizon, versus overhead, along with a wide FOV (WA shot)?  I''ve noticed "star trails" in some of my shots with less than 30 seconds. Congrats on the blue; well deserved.', '2007-03-02 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
