(3423825, 471797, 66597, '<td valign="top">Look at those comments - a lot of people really loved this photo! I found it a bit soft for my taste, and would like to see the whole reflection of the heron, but I thought the subtle quality of the tree reflection was brilliant. Interesting OOB entry!</td>', 'Look at those comments - a lot of people really loved this photo! I found it a bit soft for my taste, and would like to see the whole reflection of the heron, but I thought the subtle quality of the tree reflection was brilliant. Interesting OOB entry!', '2007-03-02 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423829, 472222, 66597, '<td valign="top">I see the tree with no problem on my monitor, but a lot of people don''t have high res or calibration, so they dinged you... this is a humorous photo, gave me a chuckle, with well-exposed snow.</td>', 'I see the tree with no problem on my monitor, but a lot of people don''t have high res or calibration, so they dinged you... this is a humorous photo, gave me a chuckle, with well-exposed snow.', '2007-03-02 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423835, 473281, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on the grass - backlighting and/or evening light is always a good choice :-) I admit I vacillated on scoring, because the pieces of garbage in b/g detracted me a bit. Good color temp on this, btw.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on the grass - backlighting and/or evening light is always a good choice :-) I admit I vacillated on scoring, because the pieces of garbage in b/g detracted me a bit. Good color temp on this, btw.', '2007-03-02 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423843, 472813, 66597, '<td valign="top">You did a fine job with exposure and the colors are very pleasing. I think what hurt you on this one was the lack of a definable subject area - I agree that I would have liked to have seen more of the tree or more negative space on either right or left. Still think you should have gotten a bit higher score, though - it was a solid entry.</td>', 'You did a fine job with exposure and the colors are very pleasing. I think what hurt you on this one was the lack of a definable subject area - I agree that I would have liked to have seen more of the tree or more negative space on either right or left. Still think you should have gotten a bit higher score, though - it was a solid entry.', '2007-03-02 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423850, 473602, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don, this title was really something :-) There are many ways to interpret that, some of them pretty scary. My husband got a look of horror and clenched up when I showed him. Maybe because he just had exam for his 40th. But it certainly made me laugh!<br/> <br/>BTW - one small item to consider would be to set white balance to "open shade" for a shot you can''t correct in PS. It would have eliminated that blue tone to the snow. (Of course maybe you wanted that tone, in which case flog me with a wet noodle and I''ll shut up!)</td>', 'Don, this title was really something :-) There are many ways to interpret that, some of them pretty scary. My husband got a look of horror and clenched up when I showed him. Maybe because he just had exam for his 40th. But it certainly made me laugh! BTW - one small item to consider would be to set white balance to "open shade" for a shot you can''t correct in PS. It would have eliminated that blue tone to the snow. (Of course maybe you wanted that tone, in which case flog me with a wet noodle and I''ll shut up!)', '2007-03-02 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423902, 473436, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very cool, awesome tree, well done</td>', 'Very cool, awesome tree, well done', '2007-03-02 18:27:38.000000', NULL, 0),
