(3424585, 473572, 58728, '<td valign="top">I understand the photo!  It seemed that images in this challenge got higher scores for having the whole tree included.  But, I do especially like the lighting in your pic.  It''s peaking out from the background, but gives a warm tone to the photo. Maybe if the ladder were more visible...without the bush engulfing it...it would have done better? It seems a bit busy at the front.  I do like it.</td>', 'I understand the photo!  It seemed that images in this challenge got higher scores for having the whole tree included.  But, I do especially like the lighting in your pic.  It''s peaking out from the background, but gives a warm tone to the photo. Maybe if the ladder were more visible...without the bush engulfing it...it would have done better? It seems a bit busy at the front.  I do like it.', '2007-03-03 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424662, 470863, 64176, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, Judi.</td>', 'gorgeous, Judi.', '2007-03-03 00:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424672, 473436, 46601, '<td valign="top">simply amazing ... very well done</td>', 'simply amazing ... very well done', '2007-03-03 01:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424676, 473068, 64176, '<td valign="top">nice overall composition.  i like!</td>', 'nice overall composition.  i like!', '2007-03-03 01:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424688, 470865, 64176, '<td valign="top">you got robbed.  this is really pretty and funky.</td>', 'you got robbed.  this is really pretty and funky.', '2007-03-03 01:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424692, 473660, 64176, '<td valign="top">this rocks!</td>', 'this rocks!', '2007-03-03 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424694, 473564, 64176, '<td valign="top">funny that you put "I need the whole tree" on so many people''s photos, but your own doesn''t have a whole tree, just stumps.  i like it though. :-)</td>', 'funny that you put "I need the whole tree" on so many people''s photos, but your own doesn''t have a whole tree, just stumps.  i like it though. :-)', '2007-03-03 01:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424719, 473551, 1031, '<td valign="top">Your description reminded me of the story of how Galen Rowell acquired [url=//mountainlight.com/gallery.tibet/images.html]this image in Tibet. I don''t recall all the details, but I think it involved running about a half-mile across a muddy field with all his camera gear to get to the right spot in time.<br/> <br/>Talk about optical coincidences, I think with just a little burning-in you can make that into a funnel-cloud in the background.</td>', 'Your description reminded me of the story of how Galen Rowell acquired [url=//mountainlight.com/gallery.tibet/images.html]this image in Tibet. I don''t recall all the details, but I think it involved running about a half-mile across a muddy field with all his camera gear to get to the right spot in time. Talk about optical coincidences, I think with just a little burning-in you can make that into a funnel-cloud in the background.', '2007-03-03 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424742, 473362, 54778, '<td valign="top">Very Good composition..good use of the surrounding and the lighting..</td>', 'Very Good composition..good use of the surrounding and the lighting..', '2007-03-03 01:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424761, 472110, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ditto Melethia, and I respect your cropping choice which favours the tree, giving slight torque to the scene which works dynamically for me.</td>', 'Ditto Melethia, and I respect your cropping choice which favours the tree, giving slight torque to the scene which works dynamically for me.', '2007-03-03 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424792, 473291, 69008, '<td valign="top">This tree looks completely different from the pines we have here in Florida.  That''s not a bad thing though. The pines here grow straight up, dropping lower limbs as they get taller. <br/>I see you used the white cloud to echo the shape of the tree in this one.</td>', 'This tree looks completely different from the pines we have here in Florida.  That''s not a bad thing though. The pines here grow straight up, dropping lower limbs as they get taller. I see you used the white cloud to echo the shape of the tree in this one.', '2007-03-03 02:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424796, 473721, 54778, '<td valign="top">aww.. This was my pick for the ribbon... anyway.. topten is as good a place.. Great Job!</td>', 'aww.. This was my pick for the ribbon... anyway.. topten is as good a place.. Great Job!', '2007-03-03 02:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424814, 472424, 54292, '<td valign="top">12th u must be so happy!! Gratz and well done :)</td>', '12th u must be so happy!! Gratz and well done :)', '2007-03-03 02:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424822, 473551, 47487, '<td valign="top">I think I know exactly where that tree is. Is it on the way from Cathey''s Valley to Merced? I have photographed trees in there dozens of times... any shopping trip to the Valley is bound to take extra time due to absolutely necessary photography stops on the way there and back. This shot is simply gorgeous; what a capture, and congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'I think I know exactly where that tree is. Is it on the way from Cathey''s Valley to Merced? I have photographed trees in there dozens of times... any shopping trip to the Valley is bound to take extra time due to absolutely necessary photography stops on the way there and back. This shot is simply gorgeous; what a capture, and congratulations on your ribbon.', '2007-03-03 02:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3424829, 473551, 70828, '<td valign="top">"The harder I work, the luckier I get! Great capture, Mark.</td>', '"The harder I work, the luckier I get! Great capture, Mark.', '2007-03-03 02:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3425016, 473436, 70828, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and Bizarre! ... Well executed! Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful and Bizarre! ... Well executed! Congratulations on the blue.', '2007-03-03 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3425053, 471809, 51793, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how many times I read and reread the rules to this challenge and knew that it was okay to crop the image. That is the only reason I did. This was not intentional cheating I promise. It was a pure accident. <br/> <br/>Besides no one liked my picture anyway. So whatever!!!<br/></td>', 'I don''t know how many times I read and reread the rules to this challenge and knew that it was okay to crop the image. That is the only reason I did. This was not intentional cheating I promise. It was a pure accident.  Besides no one liked my picture anyway. So whatever!!!', '2007-03-03 07:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3425163, 473436, 57392, '<td valign="top">another great shot.Congratulations Alex.</td>', 'another great shot.Congratulations Alex.', '2007-03-03 09:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3425379, 473436, 44877, '<td valign="top">I think you are a genius. To be able to create such a surreal effect with no editing is magnificent.</td>', 'I think you are a genius. To be able to create such a surreal effect with no editing is magnificent.', '2007-03-03 11:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426116, 473372, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great picture Jimmy!  Congratulations on the top 20!</td>', 'Great picture Jimmy!  Congratulations on the top 20!', '2007-03-03 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426297, 473436, 4793, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy that you won with this beautiful shot, congratulations</td>', 'I''m so happy that you won with this beautiful shot, congratulations', '2007-03-03 18:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426412, 473436, 15305, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!! A real Masterpiece!!  Congratulations on the blue, and I concur with you about knowing your tool of the trade and trying to get the best result out of it.</td>', 'What a great shot!! A real Masterpiece!!  Congratulations on the blue, and I concur with you about knowing your tool of the trade and trying to get the best result out of it.', '2007-03-03 19:29:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426620, 471782, 48228, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of this image, and especially love the sepia tones, as it gives it an aging quality, all of its own. <br/>Wonderful capture, and you should be very proud of this one.</td>', 'I am in awe of this image, and especially love the sepia tones, as it gives it an aging quality, all of its own. Wonderful capture, and you should be very proud of this one.', '2007-03-03 21:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426745, 473620, 67697, '<td valign="top">I personally would not have known what this was because I do not know what an avacado looks like lol.  However, I do like the composition and coloring.  The leaves are nice and sharp and do stand out from the background.  Good luck on your tree growing!  Looks like it is doing well!</td>', 'I personally would not have known what this was because I do not know what an avacado looks like lol.  However, I do like the composition and coloring.  The leaves are nice and sharp and do stand out from the background.  Good luck on your tree growing!  Looks like it is doing well!', '2007-03-03 23:10:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426763, 473436, 60174, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely amazing.  I just have no other words to describe it. I love the green glow, the orange clouds... you can even distinctly see the different colours of the stars.</td>', 'This is absolutely amazing.  I just have no other words to describe it. I love the green glow, the orange clouds... you can even distinctly see the different colours of the stars.', '2007-03-03 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3426810, 472222, 67694, '<td valign="top">If there is one thing I''ve learned here in my short history at DPC is that the subject of the challenge better be the subject of your photo -or else.  God forbid it''s not the main subject and so blatently obvious that it knocks you over.<br/>Folks can be narrow minded here -just as anywhere else.  Case in point:in the current ice challange, someone commented on my photo saying that they ''didn''t know how this [photo] honors winter''.  Hello!? the theme is ''ice''.</td>', 'If there is one thing I''ve learned here in my short history at DPC is that the subject of the challenge better be the subject of your photo -or else.  God forbid it''s not the main subject and so blatently obvious that it knocks you over.Folks can be narrow minded here -just as anywhere else.  Case in point:in the current ice challange, someone commented on my photo saying that they ''didn''t know how this [photo] honors winter''.  Hello!? the theme is ''ice''.', '2007-03-03 23:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3427680, 473436, 71249, '<td valign="top">Great ambiance and congratulations for a well deserved blue ribbon.<br/>Franklin</td>', 'Great ambiance and congratulations for a well deserved blue ribbon.Franklin', '2007-03-04 12:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3428561, 473679, 35122, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  Great song!!!</td>', 'Great shot!!  Great song!!!', '2007-03-04 19:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3428670, 473551, 64462, '<td valign="top">Your description could be a separate masterpiece!</td>', 'Your description could be a separate masterpiece!', '2007-03-04 19:54:49.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3428737, 473013, 58800, '<td valign="top">good work, like the perspective that you got in this shot and it definitely, works well in b&amp;w now I''m just trying to figure out where in Edinburgh this was taken :P</td>', 'good work, like the perspective that you got in this shot and it definitely, works well in b&w now I''m just trying to figure out where in Edinburgh this was taken :P', '2007-03-04 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3428789, 473013, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great picture, nice processing, and good title.  I didn''t vote on it, but my guess is that the trees weren''t prominent enough... DPCers like to be hit over the head with the challenge theme.</td>', 'Great picture, nice processing, and good title.  I didn''t vote on it, but my guess is that the trees weren''t prominent enough... DPCers like to be hit over the head with the challenge theme.', '2007-03-04 20:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3429364, 472137, 48560, '<td valign="top">you made the right choice picking this one.<br/>congrats!</td>', 'you made the right choice picking this one.congrats!', '2007-03-05 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3429966, 473288, 52992, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photo !</td>', 'What a wonderful photo !', '2007-03-05 08:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430283, 470244, 66597, '<td valign="top">Hi Jeffrey, I gave you a nice score for this shot, definitely underrated. The star effect is great, and cool perspective!</td>', 'Hi Jeffrey, I gave you a nice score for this shot, definitely underrated. The star effect is great, and cool perspective!', '2007-03-05 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430481, 471782, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought for sure I commented on this - loved it.  Reminds me of a giant tree out in Santa Barbara with a similar spread and age.  And for out of camera, I was VERY impressed with the lighting and composition - very nice indeed!</td>', 'I thought for sure I commented on this - loved it.  Reminds me of a giant tree out in Santa Barbara with a similar spread and age.  And for out of camera, I was VERY impressed with the lighting and composition - very nice indeed!', '2007-03-05 12:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430567, 471782, 57229, '<td valign="top">Flamin'' Ada that''s a tree and nine halves. The lighting <b>is</b> difficult, but you done good. As for the passers-by, there should be some younger tree to string em'' up.</td>', 'Flamin'' Ada that''s a tree and nine halves. The lighting is difficult, but you done good. As for the passers-by, there should be some younger tree to string em'' up.', '2007-03-05 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430633, 471782, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow, Catherine - I need to "not expect much" for scores more often! :)</td>', 'Wow, Catherine - I need to "not expect much" for scores more often! :)', '2007-03-05 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430643, 470208, 57229, '<td valign="top">Good for your wife. This is a terrific picture with a harmonious linear composition (or something like that). The fact that it nevertheless garnered a score under 6.5 is manifest evidence that you are among Philistines. Present company excepted. Had you been able to eretain the compositional theme (i.e. keep the unbroken wall background) while including the top of the tree and the rest of it to the right, then it might have improved the result. Maybe. Way underrated shot, anyway.</td>', 'Good for your wife. This is a terrific picture with a harmonious linear composition (or something like that). The fact that it nevertheless garnered a score under 6.5 is manifest evidence that you are among Philistines. Present company excepted. Had you been able to eretain the compositional theme (i.e. keep the unbroken wall background) while including the top of the tree and the rest of it to the right, then it might have improved the result. Maybe. Way underrated shot, anyway.', '2007-03-05 13:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430781, 473145, 50641, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be Central Park.  Great tree definition.  My eye is drawn to their contrasts because Ralph is almost a silhouette.  Amazing that you got such a lovely, meaningful b/w with such a simple conversion.  I see this extreme depth of focus and from-the-hip perspective (is it?) in several of your photos.  It''s very effective at conveying a sort of tunnel of loneliness and yearning.  I''m initially drawn to the moody foreground subject, but these images also make me want to know what is way back there, beyond my reach.</td>', 'I thought this might be Central Park.  Great tree definition.  My eye is drawn to their contrasts because Ralph is almost a silhouette.  Amazing that you got such a lovely, meaningful b/w with such a simple conversion.  I see this extreme depth of focus and from-the-hip perspective (is it?) in several of your photos.  It''s very effective at conveying a sort of tunnel of loneliness and yearning.  I''m initially drawn to the moody foreground subject, but these images also make me want to know what is way back there, beyond my reach.', '2007-03-05 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3430854, 473239, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like the brightness and shadows on the tree!  Enjoyed the tilt.  The landscape in the background has a neat almost-monotone olive hue, which serves to deaccentuate it and keep my attention on the tree and sky.</td>', 'I like the brightness and shadows on the tree!  Enjoyed the tilt.  The landscape in the background has a neat almost-monotone olive hue, which serves to deaccentuate it and keep my attention on the tree and sky.', '2007-03-05 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431007, 473738, 47274, '<td valign="top">i love this, its so cool and ....i dont know, its just amazing!</td>', 'i love this, its so cool and ....i dont know, its just amazing!', '2007-03-05 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431141, 472496, 33352, '<td valign="top">...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-05 16:01:45.</i></td>', '...', '2007-03-05 16:01:04.000000', '2007-03-05 16:01:45.000000', 0),
(3431524, 473517, 70661, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot! I love palm trees.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot! I love palm trees.', '2007-03-05 17:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431530, 471782, 70661, '<td valign="top">Strangest looking tree I have ever seen. I really like this shot!</td>', 'Strangest looking tree I have ever seen. I really like this shot!', '2007-03-05 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431534, 473068, 70661, '<td valign="top">Looks like it might be in the lake next year. Love the blue sky and the little puffy clouds. Nice shot.</td>', 'Looks like it might be in the lake next year. Love the blue sky and the little puffy clouds. Nice shot.', '2007-03-05 17:39:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431672, 470208, 70661, '<td valign="top">I really like the tree against the red wall. Looks great.</td>', 'I really like the tree against the red wall. Looks great.', '2007-03-05 18:36:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431838, 473068, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The ice in the river reminds me of here. Ice, Ice everywhere.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The ice in the river reminds me of here. Ice, Ice everywhere.', '2007-03-05 19:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431846, 473525, 23484, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot Jeb. I think what I like most is the clouds.  You should play with this in PS and mess with them and see what happens.<br/> <br/>Also, I see some dust bunnies.</td>', 'Interesting shot Jeb. I think what I like most is the clouds.  You should play with this in PS and mess with them and see what happens. Also, I see some dust bunnies.', '2007-03-05 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431852, 471235, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot.  I think the clouds really stand out well here and I like their colors. Well composed.</td>', 'This is a neat shot.  I think the clouds really stand out well here and I like their colors. Well composed.', '2007-03-05 19:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431859, 473314, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think the strongest point in this image is the compositon. Everything is just layed out so perfectly. This also has very nice use of "rule of thirds" I like the 3 layers.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think the strongest point in this image is the compositon. Everything is just layed out so perfectly. This also has very nice use of "rule of thirds" I like the 3 layers.', '2007-03-05 20:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3431866, 472813, 23484, '<td valign="top">I agree with Catherine, I think you needed to show more of the tree. Right now it just seems like something is missing.  I think the color of the sky helps create and interesting silhouette.</td>', 'I agree with Catherine, I think you needed to show more of the tree. Right now it just seems like something is missing.  I think the color of the sky helps create and interesting silhouette.', '2007-03-05 20:03:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3432676, 472137, 38127, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo.. yet another ribbon... and well deserved in this one too, the lighting is pretty cool.. (i havent figured out how to get stars yet..but tis a goal)  <br/> <br/>congratulations on a beautiful shot :)</td>', 'Woo hoo.. yet another ribbon... and well deserved in this one too, the lighting is pretty cool.. (i havent figured out how to get stars yet..but tis a goal)   congratulations on a beautiful shot :)', '2007-03-06 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
