(3466506, 473109, 20530, '<td valign="top">Lovely old tree. It certainly met the challenge, and I really like the nice, muted tones and the soft lighting. A very challenging subject, and one that is hard to confine within 640 pixels. I think the complexity is what kept me from voting higher on this one. The strong diagonal of the fallen branch is nice, but the overall balance is a bit off with the amount of real estate taken by the trunk and where that line cuts the image. The rest of the branches push it into the "busy" category.</td>', 'Lovely old tree. It certainly met the challenge, and I really like the nice, muted tones and the soft lighting. A very challenging subject, and one that is hard to confine within 640 pixels. I think the complexity is what kept me from voting higher on this one. The strong diagonal of the fallen branch is nice, but the overall balance is a bit off with the amount of real estate taken by the trunk and where that line cuts the image. The rest of the branches push it into the "busy" category.', '2007-03-16 12:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
