(3655314, 470750, 39057, '<td valign="top">To use one of your favorite comments hahn....please "think outside the box".<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> An artistic effort which doesn''t work too well for me.  The vertical lines seem to be tilted.  The varying light might have been very pleasant, but the blur effect makes it impossible to know. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'To use one of your favorite comments hahn....please "think outside the box". Originally posted by hahn23: An artistic effort which doesn''t work too well for me.  The vertical lines seem to be tilted.  The varying light might have been very pleasant, but the blur effect makes it impossible to know. ', '2007-05-16 10:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
