(3662186, 470750, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers, I''m glad to happen across this lovely image! Immediately drawn in by the rich inviting green tones. Then you see just enough detail, as if behind a shear veil, that the context is totally there, and the viewer feels rewarded for his pause to study the photo. Great tilted lines that seem to flow, again, as if a shear curtain fluttering in a soft summer breeze. This just takes my eye, and pleasantly allows me to sway back and forth across the image, taking it all in lazily. What a great feeling it gives me, like lying back in a hammock, in a secluded forest, drifting slowly into dreamland on an early summers eve. <br/> <br/>...oh, by the way, I like this shot ;-) going into favs!</td>', 'Wowsers, I''m glad to happen across this lovely image! Immediately drawn in by the rich inviting green tones. Then you see just enough detail, as if behind a shear veil, that the context is totally there, and the viewer feels rewarded for his pause to study the photo. Great tilted lines that seem to flow, again, as if a shear curtain fluttering in a soft summer breeze. This just takes my eye, and pleasantly allows me to sway back and forth across the image, taking it all in lazily. What a great feeling it gives me, like lying back in a hammock, in a secluded forest, drifting slowly into dreamland on an early summers eve.  ...oh, by the way, I like this shot ;-) going into favs!', '2007-05-18 01:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3716898, 473538, 66494, '<td valign="top">So sad, wish it''d remain standing and attracting many more photos for years.</td>', 'So sad, wish it''d remain standing and attracting many more photos for years.', '2007-05-30 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 0),
